2. **Harden only via `lib/truth` + existing guards** (`ssrf-guard`, `safe-fetch-image`, `upload-mime`, `rejectCrossSiteMutation`). Do not reintroduce bare `fetch(userUrl)`.
3. **Never overwrite Google Sheet formulas** (Brightline Image Uploads tab).
4. **Never weaken CSRF, MIME allowlists, or core-nav freeze** without an explicit user request.
5. Service area stays NJ/NY metro only (`SERVICE_AREA_LOCATIONS` / `BRAND.contact.locations`).
6. Deferred is not baseline: CSP nonce migration may come later; do not treat `unsafe-inline` cleanup as an excuse to change UX.

